data: {"id": "00832d9cbbff4502-thinking-parallel_evidence-814", "run_id": "00832d9cbbff4502", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中，当前 **Phase = Pending**，`containerStatuses.app.reason = ContainerCreating`，未进入 Running。\n2. **核心事件（直接根因证据）**：\n   - `FailedMount` (x33 over 53m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - `FailedMount` (x20 over 51m): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]... timed out waiting for the condition`\n3. **Pod YAML 关键配置**：\n   - Volumes 定义：`{\"name\": \"input\"", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789048225499, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

