data: {"id": "00832d9cbbff4502-final", "run_id": "00832d9cbbff4502", "seq": 819, "ts_ms": 1789048240046, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod配置引用了不存在的ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'且未设置为Optional，导致挂载卷失败，容器无法启动。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Config | `container.volumeMount` | `configMap: name=unavailable-config` (未标记为 Optional) | 直接定位到挂载卷失败的根本配置来源 |\n| 2 | K8s State | `container.waiting_reason` | `ContainerCreating` | 确认容器因环境准备失败而阻塞在启动前 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | `event.reason: FailedMount` | `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 确认缺失的 ConfigMap 是导致挂载卷失败的确切原因 |\n| 4 | Metric | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` | `reason=ContainerCreating` | 跨系统观测到与 Kubernetes 状态一致的阻塞原因 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n1. 证据 3 的事件错误信息直接将挂载失败原因指向 `unavailable-config` ConfigMap 不存在。\n2. 证据 1 的配置事实表明该 ConfigMap 是强制挂载项（非 Optional），解释了为什么配置缺失会导致硬阻断。\n3. 证据 2 和 4 分别从 Kubernetes 状态和 Prometheus 指标层面交叉验证了 Pod 处于 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，与挂载失败导致的容器无法就绪完全吻合。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\nPod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (且未配置为 Optional)\n\t→ kubelet 执行挂载卷操作时查找不到 ConfigMap\n\t→ 触发 FailedMount 错误并阻塞容器启动环境准备\n\t→ Pod 状态长时间维持在 Pending / ContainerCreating，无法进入 Running 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n当前集群问题根因已确认：**Pod 配置错误**。\n具体而言，工作负载 `workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` 的卷挂载配置引用了一个名为 `unavailable-config` 的 ConfigMap，但该资源在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在，且挂载项未设置为 `Optional: true`。这导致 Kubernetes 调度器在准备容器运行时环境时，无法完成卷挂载，进而使容器始终处于等待状态 (`ContainerCreating`)，无法进入运行状态（证据编号 1、2、3、4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 19.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 39.9s (Evidence 33.3s, RCA 6.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 67.569, "metrics": {"run_id": "00832d9cbbff4502", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 67.57263565063477, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 67572.63565063477, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 62303.0686378479, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14114.251613616943, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4944.618225097656}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 19731.847524642944, "success": true}, "parall